: 1856.04, "end": 1859.9, "text": " We started this journey by acknowledging our inherent bias against rules.", "tokens": [50855, 492, 1409, 341, 4671, 538, 30904, 527, 26387, 12577, 1970, 4474, 13, 51048], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16576664422148019, "compression_ratio": 1.5916030534351144, "no_speech_prob": 1.6299906303168799e-12}, {"id": 469, "seek": 184624, "start": 1860.3, "end": 1863.5, "text": " We view constraints as cages that limit our potential.", "tokens": [51068, 492, 1910, 18491, 382, 45888, 300, 4948, 527, 3995, 13, 51228], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16576664422148019, "compression_ratio": 1.5916030534351144, "no_speech_prob": 1.6299906303168799e-12}, {"id": 470, "seek": 184624, "start": 1864.22, "end": 1867.9, "text": " But throughout this text, the mathematics have proven the exact opposite.", "tokens": [51264, 583, 3710, 341, 2487, 11, 264, 18666, 362, 12785, 264, 1900, 6182, 13, 51448], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16576664422148019, "compression_ratio": 1.5916030534351144, "no_speech_prob": 1.6299906303168799e-12}, {"id": 471, "seek": 184624, "start": 1868.16, "end": 1869.02, "text": " They really have.", "tokens": [51461, 814, 534, 362, 13, 51504], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16576664422148019, "compression_ratio": 1.5916030534351144, "no_speech_prob": 1.6299906303168799e-12}, {"id": 472, "seek": 186902, "start": 1869.02, "end": 1876.6399999999999, "text": " It is the constraint, the strict limitation that actually births the structure, the meaning and the utility of the system.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 307, 264, 25534, 11, 264, 10910, 27432, 300, 767, 3965, 82, 264, 3877, 11, 264, 3620, 293, 264, 14877, 295, 264, 1185, 13, 50746], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10927389709042831, "compression_ratio": 1.782383419689119, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619887974536618e-12}, {"id": 473, "seek": 186902, "start": 1877.04, "end": 1885.66, "text": " Without the constraint, without the transition rules pruning the 